							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Intelligent energy use savings
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">AI Energy Mode
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">AI analyzes your usage patterns and external conditions, and reduces the air conditioner’s energy use. It controls the compressor’s frequency, reducing energy consumption by up to 30%*. And AI Energy mode can save energy by switching devices to Energy Saving mode at a pre-set threshold.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing on the AR07D9181HZ3 model. The compressor’s indicated frequency is reduced by 27% using the compressor’s lowest output control, which is reduced from the existing 15rps to 12rps (may differ by model). The testing was conducted in Samsung’s 132m² residential environment laboratory at a temperature of 35°C/24°C (dry bulb/wet bulb, KS C 9306: air conditioner). Requires the use of the SmartThings App and a Samsung account. Actual savings may vary by usage patterns and environment. </span>
