								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Fast Cooling
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Cool rooms rapidly. The twin compressor works stably at any speed, as its two cylinders rotate alternately. The BLDC motor’s Neodymium magnets are 3x stronger than normal, which generates powerful and rapid rotation. So it cools the air 43% faster* and disperses cool air farther and wider**.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing on the AR12TXCAAWKEU model compared with the Samsung conventional AQ12EASER model, measuring the time taken to reduce the room temperature from 33°C to 25°C.
<br />** Based on internal testing on the AR24TXFCAWKNEU model.</span>
							</div>
