							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Save energy cooling
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Energy Saving
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Save energy but stay comfortably cool with highly energy-efficient Digital Inverter Boost technology. It maintains the desired temperature without frequently turning off and on, so there is less fluctuation. And it enhances its power usage when cooling, which reduces energy use by up to 73%*.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing on the AR09TXCAAWKNEU model compared with the Samsung conventional model AQ09TSLXEA.</span>
