									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148891/pk-feature-get-warm-faster-546618749?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148891/pk-feature-get-warm-faster-546618750?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows warm air coming from the AR9500T indoor unit installed in the living room.
" data-mobile-alt="Shows warm air coming from the AR9500T indoor unit installed in the living room.
