										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148891/pk-feature-get-warm-faster-546618749?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148891/pk-feature-get-warm-faster-546618750?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows warm air coming from the AR9500T indoor unit installed in the living room.
