							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Less noise at home
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Low Noise
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Cool your living spaces with less noise. The twin compressor creates 20 times less vibration than a single compressor. Samsung’s patented Twin Tube Muffler also reduces refrigerant flow noise. And its WindFree™ operation reduces ambient noise, so there is a 40% reduction in detectable sound*.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing. Generates a 40% reduction in the 1kHz noise band, which is the weakest level of sound that humans are sensitive to.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
