					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148892/pk-feature-lasting-peace-of-mind-546618737?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148892/pk-feature-lasting-peace-of-mind-546618738?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The compressor inside the outdoor unit is shown, and an emblem that says &#39;10-year warranty - on the compressor - Digital inverter technology&#39; is shown in front of it.
