					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148890/pk-feature-fits-in-many-places-546618735?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148890/pk-feature-fits-in-many-places-546618736?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The compressor inside the outdoor unit is shown, and an emblem that says &#39;10-year warranty - on the compressor - Digital inverter technology&#39; is shown in front of it." data-mobile-alt="The compressor inside the outdoor unit is shown, and an emblem that says &#39;10-year warranty - on the compressor - Digital inverter technology&#39; is shown in front of it." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148890/pk-feature-fits-in-many-places-546618735?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148890/pk-feature-fits-in-many-places-546618736?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The compressor inside the outdoor unit is shown, and an emblem that says &#39;10-year warranty - on the compressor - Digital inverter technology&#39; is shown in front of it." data-mobile-alt="The compressor inside the outdoor unit is shown, and an emblem that says &#39;10-year warranty - on the compressor - Digital inverter technology&#39; is shown in front of it." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Fits in many places
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">New Slim Outdoor Units
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Make good use of valuable space and save energy. The volume of the slim outdoor unit* has been reduced by 20%** by utilizing compact core components, which also improve its energy efficiency by 20%**. And its simplified exterior eliminates painting and reduces the use of screws when installing.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* 85L model only.
<br />** Based on internal testing compared to Samsung’s existing outdoor unit.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
