								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148894/pk-feature-zero-odp---lower-gwp--546618743?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148894/pk-feature-zero-odp---lower-gwp--546618744?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="R32 (HFC) is in a circle above the front of the outdoor unit, and the surrounding area is divided into four, with ozone layer protection, LCCP, economic performance, and energy efficiency written on them respectively." data-mobile-alt="R32 (HFC) is in a circle above the front of the outdoor unit, and the surrounding area is divided into four, with ozone layer protection, LCCP, economic performance, and energy efficiency written on them respectively." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148894/pk-feature-zero-odp---lower-gwp--546618743?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148894/pk-feature-zero-odp---lower-gwp--546618744?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="R32 (HFC) is in a circle above the front of the outdoor unit, and the surrounding area is divided into four, with ozone layer protection, LCCP, economic performance, and energy efficiency written on them respectively." data-mobile-alt="R32 (HFC) is in a circle above the front of the outdoor unit, and the surrounding area is divided into four, with ozone layer protection, LCCP, economic performance, and energy efficiency written on them respectively." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Zero ODP &amp; lower GWP*
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">R32 Refrigerant
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">R32 refrigerant helps conserve the ozone layer and has less impact on global warming. It has zero Ozone Depletion Potential (ODP) and a lower Global Warming Potential (GWP) compared to conventional R22 or R410A refrigerants* that are commonly used.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* GWP by refrigerant: R32 = 675, R22 = 1810, R410A = 2090.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				   
				</div>
			
