							</div>
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Get close. Turn on.
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Quick Remote
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Control the room temperature quickly and easily on a Galaxy smartphone*. When you get close to the air conditioner**, a Quick Remote pops up on your phone*** to let you control its priority features, like on/off and start/stop****. So don’t need to waste time finding the actual remote control. 
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Only available when using Samsung Galaxy smartphones. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required.
<br />** The air conditioner must be connected to the Wi-Fi network and registered in the SmartThings App. Only certain models of air conditioners manufactured in 2024 or later are supported.
<br />*** The automatic activation time varies depending on the user environment.
<br />**** The controllable functions of compatible devices may vary depending on their specification or the usage environment, especially B2B products and some special models manufactured in 2024.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:1"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148853/pk-feature-visual-control-of-space-546618679?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148853/pk-feature-visual-control-of-space-546618680?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="From outside the house, the smartphone is used to monitor the interior through SmartThings&#39; &#39;Map View&#39;, displaying a 3D map of the home." data-mobile-alt="From outside the house, the smartphone is used to monitor the interior through SmartThings&#39; &#39;Map View&#39;, displaying a 3D map of the home." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148853/pk-feature-visual-control-of-space-546618679?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148853/pk-feature-visual-control-of-space-546618680?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="From outside the house, the smartphone is used to monitor the interior through SmartThings&#39; &#39;Map View&#39;, displaying a 3D map of the home." data-mobile-alt="From outside the house, the smartphone is used to monitor the interior through SmartThings&#39; &#39;Map View&#39;, displaying a 3D map of the home." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Visual control of space
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Map View
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Monitor and control all your air conditioners wherever you are. Using Map View in the SmartThings App*, you can see a 3D map of your home and smart devices. You can change settings, run preset routines and monitor the air quality, room temperature and energy consumption of your air conditioner.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:2"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148848/pk-feature-simply-smart-control-546618671?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148848/pk-feature-simply-smart-control-546618672?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows a person relaxing while controlling the air conditioning with their voice using a voice assistant on their smartphone, such as Samsung Bixby, Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. The example voice command shown says: &#34;Hi, Bixby! Turn on the wind free of the air conditioner.&#34;" data-mobile-alt="Shows a person relaxing while controlling the air conditioning with their voice using a voice assistant on their smartphone, such as Samsung Bixby, Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. The example voice command shown says: &#34;Hi, Bixby! Turn on the wind free of the air conditioner.&#34;" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148848/pk-feature-simply-smart-control-546618671?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148848/pk-feature-simply-smart-control-546618672?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows a person relaxing while controlling the air conditioning with their voice using a voice assistant on their smartphone, such as Samsung Bixby, Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. The example voice command shown says: &#34;Hi, Bixby! Turn on the wind free of the air conditioner.&#34;" data-mobile-alt="Shows a person relaxing while controlling the air conditioning with their voice using a voice assistant on their smartphone, such as Samsung Bixby, Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. The example voice command shown says: &#34;Hi, Bixby! Turn on the wind free of the air conditioner.&#34;" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Simply smart control
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">SmartThings &amp; Voice Control
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Control the temperature effortlessly. Using the SmartThings App* you can remotely control and monitor it with just a touch. You can also control it with your voice using a voice assistant**, such as Samsung Bixby***, Amazon Alexa**** or Google Assistant*****. It even suggests the best settings.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required.
<br />** A Wi-Fi connection is required
<br />*** Bixby is Samsung’s brand of Internet of Things (IoT) voice assistant. Bixby service availability may vary depending on country. Bixby recognizes selected languages and certain accents/dialects. The user interface may change and differ by device. The availability of Bixby features and content providers may vary depending on the country/carrier/language/device model/OS version. A Samsung account log-in and data network connection (Wi-Fi or data network) are required.
<br />**** Amazon, Alexa and all related logos are trademarks of Amazon.Com, Inc. or its affiliates.
<br />***** Google is a trademark of Google LLC.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:3"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148849/pk-feature-walk-in--feel-cool--546618673?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148849/pk-feature-walk-in--feel-cool--546618674?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays &#34;Welcome Cooling&#34; activated. When the phone enters the geofence on the map, the indoor unit is triggered to turn on via Wi-Fi." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays &#34;Welcome Cooling&#34; activated. When the phone enters the geofence on the map, the indoor unit is triggered to turn on via Wi-Fi." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148849/pk-feature-walk-in--feel-cool--546618673?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148849/pk-feature-walk-in--feel-cool--546618674?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays &#34;Welcome Cooling&#34; activated. When the phone enters the geofence on the map, the indoor unit is triggered to turn on via Wi-Fi." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays &#34;Welcome Cooling&#34; activated. When the phone enters the geofence on the map, the indoor unit is triggered to turn on via Wi-Fi." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Walk in. Feel cool.
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Welcome Cooling &amp; Away Care
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Use your air conditioner efficiently and effectively when you arrive home or go out. SmartThings Welcome &amp; Away Care* alerts when you get close to home** and reminds you to turn on the air conditioner. And when you leave** it will notify you if there is an air conditioner that is still working.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required.
<br />** The Welcome &amp; Away Care (energy saving notification) function uses smartphone Geofencing and GPS to determine whether you are close to your personal set location, and its performance may vary depending on the actual usage environment and the cooling function of each model.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:4"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148854/pk-feature-automatic-evolution-546618675?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148854/pk-feature-automatic-evolution-546618676?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Smart Forward&#34; screen, showing it connected to the indoor unit as the unit updates. At the bottom, icons for &#34;New Feature Update&#34; and &#34;Upgrade Existing Feature&#34; are displayed." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Smart Forward&#34; screen, showing it connected to the indoor unit as the unit updates. At the bottom, icons for &#34;New Feature Update&#34; and &#34;Upgrade Existing Feature&#34; are displayed." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148854/pk-feature-automatic-evolution-546618675?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148854/pk-feature-automatic-evolution-546618676?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Smart Forward&#34; screen, showing it connected to the indoor unit as the unit updates. At the bottom, icons for &#34;New Feature Update&#34; and &#34;Upgrade Existing Feature&#34; are displayed." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Smart Forward&#34; screen, showing it connected to the indoor unit as the unit updates. At the bottom, icons for &#34;New Feature Update&#34; and &#34;Upgrade Existing Feature&#34; are displayed." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Automatic evolution
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Smart Forward
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Keep your air conditioner up-to-date with the latest technology and features, so it works just like the latest products. Smart Forward* automatically installs new software** in order to upgrade the operating system and security, enhance or add new functions and help improve the SmartThings App.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* The availability of Smart Forward upgrades may vary by product and region.
<br />** Software is downloaded “over the network”, so appliances must have a Wi-Fi connection to the Internet. New updates can be monitored on the SmartThings App and will only be implemented with the agreement of users.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:5"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148850/pk-feature-smart-management-546618677?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148850/pk-feature-smart-management-546618678?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A mobile phone marked as ‘good’ and a satisfied user" data-mobile-alt="A mobile phone marked as ‘good’ and a satisfied user" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148850/pk-feature-smart-management-546618677?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148850/pk-feature-smart-management-546618678?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A mobile phone marked as ‘good’ and a satisfied user" data-mobile-alt="A mobile phone marked as ‘good’ and a satisfied user" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Smart management
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">SmartThings Home Care
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Take care of your air conditioner easily. SmartThings Home Care* uses artificial intelligence (AI) to detect abnormal behavior, so that you can address maintenance needs without an on-site service**. AI diagnosis checks its status and displays information about any issues with major components.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required.
<br />** Service callouts will occasionally be required and may incur extra repair costs.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
