								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148852/pk-feature-always-feel-comfortable-546618667?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148852/pk-feature-always-feel-comfortable-546618668?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Air Care&#34; screen, with a hazy outdoor scene visible through the window. At the bottom, the indoor air quality is monitored in a 3D view." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Air Care&#34; screen, with a hazy outdoor scene visible through the window. At the bottom, the indoor air quality is monitored in a 3D view." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148852/pk-feature-always-feel-comfortable-546618667?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148852/pk-feature-always-feel-comfortable-546618668?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Air Care&#34; screen, with a hazy outdoor scene visible through the window. At the bottom, the indoor air quality is monitored in a 3D view." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Air Care&#34; screen, with a hazy outdoor scene visible through the window. At the bottom, the indoor air quality is monitored in a 3D view." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Always feel comfortable
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">SmartThings Air Care
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Maintain a comfortable environment in your home. SmartThings Air Care* automatically controls purifying and cooling devices, based on the outdoor and indoor air quality and the temperature and humidity in each room. So it enhances the cleanliness of your air and keeps you feeling comfortable.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required. SmartThings Air Care feature may vary by region and is currently available in the following countries: Korea, USA, UAE, Chile, Poland, Australia, Indonesia.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
