					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148851/pk-feature-look-after-your-pets-546618669?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148851/pk-feature-look-after-your-pets-546618670?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Pet Care&#34; screen, showing a cat comfortably sleeping beneath the indoor unit. A &#34;Pet&#34; icon appears between the smartphone and the indoor unit." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Pet Care&#34; screen, showing a cat comfortably sleeping beneath the indoor unit. A &#34;Pet&#34; icon appears between the smartphone and the indoor unit." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148851/pk-feature-look-after-your-pets-546618669?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148851/pk-feature-look-after-your-pets-546618670?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Pet Care&#34; screen, showing a cat comfortably sleeping beneath the indoor unit. A &#34;Pet&#34; icon appears between the smartphone and the indoor unit." data-mobile-alt="The smartphone displays the &#34;Pet Care&#34; screen, showing a cat comfortably sleeping beneath the indoor unit. A &#34;Pet&#34; icon appears between the smartphone and the indoor unit." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Look after your pets
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">SmartThings Pet Care
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Care for your pets even when you are not home. SmartThings Pet Care* lets you adjust the temperature in your home to keep pets comfortable. You can turn the air conditioner on and off at a certain temperature or a set time and customize the temperature for long-haired and short-haired breeds.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
