						<use xlink:href="#previous-regular" href="#previous-regular"></use>
					</svg>
				</button>
			
				<div class="swiper-wrapper" role="list">
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:0"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148884/pk-feature-maintain-hygienically-546618733?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148884/pk-feature-maintain-hygienically-546618734?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows the 3 stages of the Freeze Wash process: Freeze quickly freezes the Heat Exchanger to cover it in frost, Defrost &amp; Wash blows in air that defrost the ice, washes away dirt and 95% of microorganisms, as proven in testing by Intertek, and Dry dries up any moisture that is left." data-mobile-alt="Shows the 3 stages of the Freeze Wash process: Freeze quickly freezes the Heat Exchanger to cover it in frost, Defrost &amp; Wash blows in air that defrost the ice, washes away dirt and 95% of microorganisms, as proven in testing by Intertek, and Dry dries up any moisture that is left." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148884/pk-feature-maintain-hygienically-546618733?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148884/pk-feature-maintain-hygienically-546618734?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows the 3 stages of the Freeze Wash process: Freeze quickly freezes the Heat Exchanger to cover it in frost, Defrost &amp; Wash blows in air that defrost the ice, washes away dirt and 95% of microorganisms, as proven in testing by Intertek, and Dry dries up any moisture that is left." data-mobile-alt="Shows the 3 stages of the Freeze Wash process: Freeze quickly freezes the Heat Exchanger to cover it in frost, Defrost &amp; Wash blows in air that defrost the ice, washes away dirt and 95% of microorganisms, as proven in testing by Intertek, and Dry dries up any moisture that is left." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Maintain hygienically
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Freeze Wash
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Keep the air conditioner clean and hygienic. Freeze Wash* quickly freezes and then defrosts the Heat Exchanger. So it is washed in water, which removes dirt and contamination, including 95% of microorganisms**. Finally, it dries up any moisture. And it alerts you when it is time for a clean***.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* The Freeze Wash function is only available on certain WindFree™ models.
<br />** Based on internal testing in accordance with Samsung protocols. Results provided to and interpreted by Intertek.
<br />*** Only available on certain models that have Wi-Fi connectivity.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:1"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148883/pk-feature-stays-fresh---hygienic-546618731?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148883/pk-feature-stays-fresh---hygienic-546618732?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows the air conditioner cleaning itself by blowing mild air for 10 minutes, or adding an extra 10 or 20 minutes of WindFree™ air if necessary." data-mobile-alt="Shows the air conditioner cleaning itself by blowing mild air for 10 minutes, or adding an extra 10 or 20 minutes of WindFree™ air if necessary." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148883/pk-feature-stays-fresh---hygienic-546618731?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148883/pk-feature-stays-fresh---hygienic-546618732?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows the air conditioner cleaning itself by blowing mild air for 10 minutes, or adding an extra 10 or 20 minutes of WindFree™ air if necessary." data-mobile-alt="Shows the air conditioner cleaning itself by blowing mild air for 10 minutes, or adding an extra 10 or 20 minutes of WindFree™ air if necessary." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Stays fresh &amp; hygienic
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">3-step Auto Clean
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Keep the air conditioner hygienic by doing nothing! After it has been working, an Auto Clean function automatically dries the Heat Exchanger using a 3-step process*. It removes moisture inside by blowing air for between 10 to 30 minutes***. So it helps prevent the buildup of bacteria and odors.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Models without WindFree™ mode will use a 2-step process (3 minutes of auto air flow and 7 minutes of high air flow).
<br />** Only WindFree™ models will check the internal humidity.
<br />*** The Auto Clean time will vary depending on the condition of the air conditioner.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:2"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148885/pk-feature-easy-to-clean-filter-546618729?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148885/pk-feature-easy-to-clean-filter-546618730?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The air conditioner cover can be lifted and easily removed." data-mobile-alt="The air conditioner cover can be lifted and easily removed." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148885/pk-feature-easy-to-clean-filter-546618729?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148885/pk-feature-easy-to-clean-filter-546618730?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The air conditioner cover can be lifted and easily removed." data-mobile-alt="The air conditioner cover can be lifted and easily removed." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Easy to clean filter
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Easy Filter
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Keep your air conditioner working efficiently with little effort. Unlike conventional filters, the Easy Filter is located outside, on the top, so it can easily be taken out and cleaned. It is made of a dense mesh, so it is very effective at capturing dust, which keeps the Heat Exchanger clean.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Tested in Korea test lab (FITI). Data has been measured under specific testing conditions and may vary depending on environmental factors and individual use.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:3"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148886/pk-feature-convenient-cleaning-546618727?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148886/pk-feature-convenient-cleaning-546618728?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The front panel of the indoor unit is shown being opened." data-mobile-alt="The front panel of the indoor unit is shown being opened." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148886/pk-feature-convenient-cleaning-546618727?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148886/pk-feature-convenient-cleaning-546618728?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The front panel of the indoor unit is shown being opened." data-mobile-alt="The front panel of the indoor unit is shown being opened." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Convenient cleaning
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Easy Open Panel
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Keep the air conditioner clean both inside and outside. The Easy Open Panel can be quickly separated from the front of the air conditioner without any separate tools, which makes it easy to clean the interior as well as the exterior of the air conditioner.
								</p>
								
							</div>
