								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148863/pk-feature-lasting-efficiency-546618693?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148863/pk-feature-lasting-efficiency-546618694?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="DuraFin is shown enlarged.
" data-mobile-alt="DuraFin is shown enlarged.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148863/pk-feature-lasting-efficiency-546618693?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148863/pk-feature-lasting-efficiency-546618694?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="DuraFin is shown enlarged.
" data-mobile-alt="DuraFin is shown enlarged.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Lasting efficiency
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">DuraFin
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Enhance the performance and efficiency of the Heat Exchanger. The DuraFin is made of a denser material and thicker in design and its improved coating has more corrosion resistance than previous models. So it passes the accelerated Sea Water Acetic Acid Test (SWAAT) for corrosion over 100 days*.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing on the AR13TYHYBWKNST model compared with the Samsung conventional model AR18JRFNFWK.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:1"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148864/pk-feature-lasting-protection-546618687?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148864/pk-feature-lasting-protection-546618688?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="DuraFin+ is shown enlarged.
" data-mobile-alt="DuraFin+ is shown enlarged.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148864/pk-feature-lasting-protection-546618687?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148864/pk-feature-lasting-protection-546618688?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="DuraFin+ is shown enlarged.
" data-mobile-alt="DuraFin+ is shown enlarged.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Lasting protection
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">DuraFin+
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Stay comfortably cool for a long time. The DuraFin+ is made of corrosion-resistant material to protect the condenser from rusting, which helps to maintain the performance and efficiency of the Heat Exchanger. Its superb corrosion-resistance was proven in a Salt Spray Test (SST) for 500 hours*.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing by applying pressure (42kgf/cm2) using nitrogen for 1 minute after a Salt Spray Test (SST) of over 500 hours, in accordance with ASTM B117 and KS D(ISO 9227).</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:2"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148865/pk-feature-long-lasting-cooling-546618697?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148865/pk-feature-long-lasting-cooling-546618698?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows a diagram illustrating the 3 layers of the Durafin™ Ultra: Raw Aluminum Material, an Anti-corrosive Layer of Epoxy Acrylic and a Hydrophilic Layer of Acrylic Resin.
" data-mobile-alt="Shows a diagram illustrating the 3 layers of the Durafin™ Ultra: Raw Aluminum Material, an Anti-corrosive Layer of Epoxy Acrylic and a Hydrophilic Layer of Acrylic Resin.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148865/pk-feature-long-lasting-cooling-546618697?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148865/pk-feature-long-lasting-cooling-546618698?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows a diagram illustrating the 3 layers of the Durafin™ Ultra: Raw Aluminum Material, an Anti-corrosive Layer of Epoxy Acrylic and a Hydrophilic Layer of Acrylic Resin.
" data-mobile-alt="Shows a diagram illustrating the 3 layers of the Durafin™ Ultra: Raw Aluminum Material, an Anti-corrosive Layer of Epoxy Acrylic and a Hydrophilic Layer of Acrylic Resin.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Long-lasting cooling
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">DuraFin Ultra
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Protect the Heat Exchanger to maintain its performance. The DuraFin Ultra has anti-corrosive and hydrophilic layers that prevent rust from forming on the Heat Exchanger. Its superb corrosion resistance was proven in a Salt Spray Test (SST) of over 3,000 hours with no refrigerant leakage*.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing by applying pressure (42kgf/cm2) using nitrogen for 1 minute after a Salt Spray Test (SST) of over 3,000 hours, in accordance with ASTM B117 (ISO 9227).</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:3"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148859/pk-feature-stable-and-durable-546618689?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148859/pk-feature-stable-and-durable-546618690?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="It shows the outdoor unit being protected from lightning.
" data-mobile-alt="It shows the outdoor unit being protected from lightning.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148859/pk-feature-stable-and-durable-546618689?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148859/pk-feature-stable-and-durable-546618690?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="It shows the outdoor unit being protected from lightning.
" data-mobile-alt="It shows the outdoor unit being protected from lightning.
" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Stable and durable
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Triple Protector Plus
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Enjoy a long-lasting performance in challenging environments. Triple Protector Plus technology prevents damage from power surges and fluctuating electrical currents, without a separate voltage stabilizer*. Its anti-corrosion coating also protects the condenser and cabinet in harsh conditions.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing on the AR12TXEAAWKNEU model compared with the Samsung conventional model AS18FCMID.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:4"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148860/pk-feature-corrosion-resistant-546618695?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148860/pk-feature-corrosion-resistant-546618696?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows the coated copper tubes inside the Heat Exchanger. A close-up says that they provide 7.5x better corrosion resistance." data-mobile-alt="Shows the coated copper tubes inside the Heat Exchanger. A close-up says that they provide 7.5x better corrosion resistance." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148860/pk-feature-corrosion-resistant-546618695?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148860/pk-feature-corrosion-resistant-546618696?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows the coated copper tubes inside the Heat Exchanger. A close-up says that they provide 7.5x better corrosion resistance." data-mobile-alt="Shows the coated copper tubes inside the Heat Exchanger. A close-up says that they provide 7.5x better corrosion resistance." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Corrosion-resistant
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Coated Copper Tube*
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Enjoy a long-lasting and consistent performance. The Heat Exchanger’s coated copper tubes have 7.5x better corrosion resistance*, protecting it against harmful environmental conditions, like dust and pollutants. So the indoor unit will work reliably for a long time and needs less maintenance.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on testing by TUV Rheinland in accordance with the ASTM G85 Annex A3 modified-SWAAT test, compared to the non-coated copper tube. The level of corrosion resistance is based on the reduction rate of the copper tube’s thickness. The original thickness of each copper tube was 206㎛. After 40 days, the coated copper tube was 186㎛ thick and the non-coated copper tube was 52㎛ thick.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:5"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148861/pk-feature-stay-cool-when-hot-546618691?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148861/pk-feature-stay-cool-when-hot-546618692?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The outdoor unit is shown installed in a scorching environment with an external temperature of 58°C, while through the window, the indoor unit is seen operating smoothly without any issues." data-mobile-alt="The outdoor unit is shown installed in a scorching environment with an external temperature of 58°C, while through the window, the indoor unit is seen operating smoothly without any issues." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148861/pk-feature-stay-cool-when-hot-546618691?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148861/pk-feature-stay-cool-when-hot-546618692?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="The outdoor unit is shown installed in a scorching environment with an external temperature of 58°C, while through the window, the indoor unit is seen operating smoothly without any issues." data-mobile-alt="The outdoor unit is shown installed in a scorching environment with an external temperature of 58°C, while through the window, the indoor unit is seen operating smoothly without any issues." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Stay cool when hot
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Cool Even at 58°C
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Stay cool in extremely hot weather. The Samsung air conditioner will continue cooling inside your home even when the outside temperature reaches up to 58°C (136°F)*. So you can feel comfortable all year round, even in the scorching summer heat.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Based on internal testing and certified by Intertek.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				   
				</div>
			
				<button type="button" class="swiper-button-next" an-tr="ftd16_interactive multi feature--arrow-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:arrow:right">
					<span class="hidden">Next</span>
					<svg class="icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
						<use xlink:href="#next-regular" href="#next-regular"></use>
					</svg>
				</button>
				
				
			
			</div>
	
