										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148879/pk-feature-works-on-any-voltage---546618719?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148879/pk-feature-works-on-any-voltage---546618720?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="Shows a wall-mounted air conditioner cooling two different living rooms. One room has a symbol showing that its electrical supply is 127V and the other has a symbol showing that its electrical supply is 220V, but both are using the same type of power outlet." data-mobile-alt="Shows a wall-mounted air conditioner cooling two different living rooms. One room has a symbol showing that its electrical supply is 127V and the other has a symbol showing that its electrical supply is 220V, but both are using the same type of power outlet." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Works on any voltage**
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Power Volt
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Stop worrying about the electrical voltage in your home. It does not matter whether you use 127V or 220V power outlets – or even both! The air conditioner has a Power Volt* function and can be safely used on either voltage**, without the extra time and cost of installing a voltage transformer.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* Only available on certain models.
<br />** Operates safely using either 127V or 220V power outlets.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
						"an-ca":"indication",
						"an-ac":"carousel",
						"an-la":"carousel:index:2"
					}'>
						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148880/pk-feature-works-non-stop-546618723?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148880/pk-feature-works-non-stop-546618724?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="‘Wireless Auto Amperage Control+ Kit’ shows that the current level of the indoor unit is adjusted to 1." data-mobile-alt="‘Wireless Auto Amperage Control+ Kit’ shows that the current level of the indoor unit is adjusted to 1." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148880/pk-feature-works-non-stop-546618723?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166148880/pk-feature-works-non-stop-546618724?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="‘Wireless Auto Amperage Control+ Kit’ shows that the current level of the indoor unit is adjusted to 1." data-mobile-alt="‘Wireless Auto Amperage Control+ Kit’ shows that the current level of the indoor unit is adjusted to 1." data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Works non-stop
								</h3>
								<h4 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__sub-headline">Auto Ampere Control+
								</h4>
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Stay comfortable if the power supply is limited. Auto Ampere Control+* starts operating in Ampere Control mode when the electrical power is limited to ensure continuous cooling or heating**. It can be remotely controlled, adjusted over 6 levels and will control all indoor units on one floor***.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">* A Wireless Auto Ampere Control+ kit is required to use this function. This function is available to use with SmartThings.
<br />** When using the Auto Ampere Control+ mode, the cooling and heating performance may be weakened so that the operating current does not exceed the set current, depending on the indoor/outdoor environment.
<br />*** One or more of the Wireless Auto Ampere Control+ kits can be installed to suit the size and environmental conditions of the installation area.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
						"an-tr":"ftd16_interactive multi feature-product detail-indicator",
